        {
          "text": "mi ma ope Yehova vu aliriaanzi dria andri opojo ti zipi ’diyi, anzi anyapani tile oko ’diyi be; agupianzi anyapa agoru ’diyi be yi Yehovani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.12",
